**Sales/prospect audit tooling lives elsewhere, on purpose.** `audit.py`
(scores any live site) and `remediate.py` (generates fixes from an audit)
are client-agnostic — they belong in the shared `seo-audit-toolkit` repo,
not here, even if a fresh copy gets used while working on this client.
`preflight.py` and `post-wave-qa.py` DO belong here — they check *this*
project's own files.

